{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "4b7ecc9bfdaaf2bce37a8b59ab7811ef0fce3903b829dc88cd8e8398998ddb7b", "ja": "しゅっ、しゅっ！　きらめく待ち針に～♪\nミシンさばきも、あざやか～♪", "zh": "唰、唰！闪闪发光的别针～♪  \n缝纫机也操作得漂亮利落～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9d9676440f5b7cc4b6cd91bba75d172796e5d58f9a5e2bddab67c2355f73183d", "ja": "（青羽さんの声が聞こえる……。\nもしかして、今、入らない方がいいのかな……）", "zh": "（听到青羽小姐的声音了……该不会，我现在还是别进去比较好吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "64f32edfce07dc8a936b7330c4d7f9de08ddb7a3beae97202fcc5feee917febb", "ja": "（でも確認事項もあるし……。\nよし、ここは覚悟を決めて……）", "zh": "（不过还有些事情要确认……好，还是做好心理准备……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1003_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b5da975bc568e6c3e34d0be42b05b4ffa3d78d114a24a85c4bcbb9209e6dd379", "ja": "あの～、青羽さん。お疲れさまです。\n一体なにを……？", "zh": "那个～，青羽小姐。辛苦了。\n你这是在……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "a8a7d9f5958ab55064f8813c054886e9727380ea295cc661724b9982573eb0fb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ、お裁縫の素振りをしてたんです♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿，我刚才在练习缝纫的动作♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "907966db1a2915847edcd411167fd2a523c53777c13d312596185739da7fc61d", "ja": "（お裁縫の素振り……）", "zh": "（缝纫的动作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "212cf50c2f5b00ad9c79db28105b28b96e3f226395fec51cbc9809ed264bff1e", "ja": "ちょっと気持ちが盛り上がっちゃって。\n私の心に、情熱の炎が灯ったものですから……！", "zh": "只是情绪有点高涨起来了。\n因为我的心中燃起了热情之火……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9794285eb092be92d61eea8c89ddb86a600730ea437f3199f0470e3e5f36f483", "ja": "情熱……そうだ！　社長からそろそろだって\n聞かされてた件の確認に来たんですけど……。", "zh": "热情……对了！社长之前跟我说差不多是时候了，\n我是来确认那件事的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "c938133ad7f75226efaa7794b6b7ec6e7bb0f28897db5ed5bb085fe530f7254c", "ja": "社長さんから……あっ、そうでした！\nあの情熱的なユニットについてですね。", "zh": "是社长那边……啊，对了！\n是关于那个充满热情的组合的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "f250aee08489678568804f43ad75c932fa050d998d99f2a20e9d034f878c3301", "ja": "ちょうど、社長さんからご連絡いただいたんです。\nすぐに来てほしいって言ってましたよ♪", "zh": "正好，社长联系我了。\n他说希望您马上过去呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bfa7171c70c528a72d31253212f8aacd0a46be6e67dcdd3f61bca3d33b3fabb0", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました！\nじゃあこのまま事務所に向かいますね！", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了！\n那我现在就直接去事务所啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "f0e7019638cccd4a0a24f2159010ab60ef8d31a2aafaaca740546e1f869e3d00", "ja": "いってらっしゃ～い♪　私は素振りじゃなくて、\n本番のお裁縫にとりかかろうっと！　しゅっしゅっ！", "zh": "慢走～♪那我也不是模拟练习，\n而是要动真格开始做针线活啦！咻、咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4431eedb1b5242ef1aaee1a684f5b2e0d447cfa588eb568845405ee262fa1021", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです！　例のユニットに\nついて、進展があるとうかがったのですが……。", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了！听说那个组合有新进展……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "81ed8b0cb0479f62731f5693c7a51337d42180a6c3faa6888042bcb756afe0ab", "ja": "やあ君か、待っていたよ！\nさあさあ、こっちへ来たまえ！", "zh": "哎呀，是你啊，我正等着你呢！\n来来，快到这边来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "bef253a988bdd4bd1a22af9d47ee11a82cbfae49dcb940fed5b3d403b70587fe", "ja": "お疲れさまです。{$P$}さんが\n来たということは……いよいよ再始動なんですね♪", "zh": "辛苦了。{$P$}先生来了，\n也就是说……终于要重新启动了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "389ff2d2baa2336453ce190d54a6da6dcbfe3a15040a7e2c6324b82fc7e7aa4b", "ja": "うむ。高山紗代子君、豊川風花君、ジュリア君、二階堂\n千鶴君のユニット、『chicAAmor』だが……。", "zh": "嗯。关于高山纱代子、丰川风花、茱莉亚、二阶堂\n千鹤组成的组合“chicAAmor”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "e5ad6649686b37feefd093c7cf13099b3c9582320b1485736f2ab704e7fd73e9", "ja": "このたび、正式に劇場公演をすることに決まった！\nもちろんプロデュースは君に一任する！", "zh": "这次正式决定要举办剧场公演了！  \n当然，全权交给你来制作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "98d818d48391743a326a6a4a77de98326231eef8361373a2be1450b7cd5f659d", "ja": "おお、ついに……！\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哦哦，终于……！\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "badf08e9581351059d8d6c3e5d4e0152924efa20b6221491f268e153bae433f0", "ja": "早速だが新曲のデモが届いている。\n歌詞はまだだが、ひとまず聴いてもらおう！", "zh": "新歌的试听音源刚送到。\n歌词还没拿到，不过先听听看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "8ce2bcfef3a0477f5b7e6a0a9948b04c9e352a48afa2d7a4f175e43a2e0e07d8", "ja": "わあ、情熱的なリズムが素敵……♪\nこれはいわゆるフラメンコ、ですよね？", "zh": "哇，好有激情的节奏，真棒……♪\n这就是所谓的弗拉明戈，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e20870116a5cdda67b07844d310ea51db2ee6f5100d31c0857b2231bf86f4844", "ja": "ですね！　『chicAAmor』の魅力を、\nさらに増してくれる楽曲だと思います！", "zh": "是吧！我觉得这首歌让『chicAAmor』的魅力更上一层楼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "75ddcb55338bd06206018caf9f9fc8ad4ffdcc3f937a9fe4fa18fc3c6f822923", "ja": "前回の公演は、急遽中止になってしまったからね。\nファンからも惜しむ声が寄せられた……。", "zh": "上次的公演临时取消了。\n粉丝们也纷纷表达了惋惜之情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "62ca2d02759a8ab4b90e91b806e0fcb061843a09af152877afd6329ac7388cc7", "ja": "ユニット結成を発表してすぐでしたからね。ファンは\nもちろん、アイドル達も無念だったと思います。", "zh": "因为当时才刚刚宣布组建组合。粉丝们自不必说，偶像们肯定也都感到很遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4418f977ce33df3ce2dd240baed943c774624815dde33bcd303fc9d4f143c249", "ja": "だからこそ、この公演は絶対に成功させてみせます！\nこれ以上ない、情熱的な公演として！", "zh": "正因如此，这场公演我一定会让它成功！\n要把它办成一场无比精彩、充满热情的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "9d7354b5d14a5bd517e93915cc67de80498afec066f215d2b769e947c8560e37", "ja": "おお！　やる気に満ちているね！\nそれでこそ、765プロのプロデューサーだ！", "zh": "哦！真是干劲十足啊！\n这才是765级专业制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "da0d0d9c7f1575740b3ed5465f3aee22d5a0ae935b422fa731770d9bb3777dbd", "ja": "ふふっ、情熱的な歌が{$P$}さんの\nハートに火をつけたみたい♪　公演が楽しみですね！", "zh": "呵呵，热情洋溢的歌声好像点燃了{$P$}先生的\n心♪ 真期待演出啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d257eda44938ebf0baa5329576b457f415239b8f72bd36096119a1dbbcd2a30a", "ja": "（公演決定を聞いたらみんな喜ぶぞ！　早速、\nスケジュールを組んで準備しないと！　オーレ！）", "zh": "（一听说公演定下来了，大家肯定都会很高兴！得赶紧排好日程开始准备才行！好嘞！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
